Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.89,0:22:09.21,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}They will finally feel the flames
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.21,0:22:13.64,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Flames that run down through my veins
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.64,0:22:17.98,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}I will make the city burn
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.98,0:22:22.34,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}We're not planning to return
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.10,0:22:26.74,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Trying so hard to be free
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.16,0:22:30.56,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}To make you see what I see
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.93,0:22:35.47,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Hold on to your wishes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.47,0:22:39.29,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}If you can't hold on to me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.49,0:22:43.09,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Forgive me for letting you down
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.98,0:22:48.34,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Forgive me for letting you down again
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.34,0:22:51.54,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}I guess I'm not strong enough
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.16,0:22:55.38,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Right now
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.20,0:23:02.74,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Oh my love
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.74,0:23:07.07,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}love
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.07,0:23:14.36,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}love
Comment: 0,0:23:14.92,0:23:16.92,op-english,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.89,0:22:09.21,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}他們終究會擦出愛情之火
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.21,0:22:13.64,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}火化為血液 在我體內流淌
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.64,0:22:17.98,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}我會引燃這座都市
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.98,0:22:22.34,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}我們從未有撤退的打算
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.10,0:22:26.74,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}努力去獲得自由
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.16,0:22:30.56,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}只為讓你見我所見
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.93,0:22:35.47,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}牢牢抓住你的期盼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.47,0:22:39.29,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}如果你無法再握住我的手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.49,0:22:43.09,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}請原諒我 讓你失望了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.98,0:22:48.34,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}請原諒我 又一次
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.34,0:22:51.54,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}我想還未擁有守護你的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.16,0:22:55.38,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}只為此時
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.20,0:23:02.74,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}哦 我的摯愛
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.74,0:23:07.07,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}我們永恆的愛
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.07,0:23:14.36,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}你我永不分離
